  "final_answer": "# iPhone Comparison: Pro vs Pro Max\n\nAccording to apple.com, the **latest iPhone model is the iPhone 18 Pro** (available for pre-order starting 9.18). Here's the comparison between the two Pro variants:\n\n| Feature | iPhone 18 Pro | iPhone 18 Pro Max |\n|---------|---------------|-------------------|\n| **Price (starting)** | $1,199 (or $49.95/mo. for 24 mo.) | $1,299 (or $54.12/mo. for 24 mo.) |\n| **Screen Size** | 6.3-inch display | 6.9-inch display |\n| **Lease from** | $34.99/mo. | $37.99/mo. |\n\n## Key Differences:\n- **Price Difference:** The Pro Max is **$100 more** than the Pro ($1,299 vs $1,199)\n- **Screen Size Difference:** The Pro Max has a **0.6-inch larger** display (6.9\" vs 6.3\")\n- **Battery:** The Pro Max also offers the longest battery life — up to 45 hours of video playback\n\n**Source:** https://www.apple.com/shop/buy-iphone/iphone-18-pro",
